  --metric: string@metric-completer-2 # Which RPKI ROA validation metric to return. validPfxsRatio = ratio of RPKI-valid prefixes (IPv4+IPv6 combined). validPfxsV4Ratio / validPfxsV6Ratio = same, split by IP version. validIpsRatio = ratio of RPKI-valid address space (IPv4 /24s + IPv6 /48s). validIpsV4Ratio / validIpsV6Ratio = same, split by IP version. (default: validPfxsRatio, e.g. validPfxsRatio)
